id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"59004ac6d23e86f8\" href=\"?note=59004ac6d23e86f8\" title=\"20-df-finite-code\">20-df-finite-code</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"84785d7ea3ad1a08\" href=\"?note=84785d7ea3ad1a08\" title=\"20-thm-cantor-compactness\">20-thm-cantor-compactness</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"b4c1ab1358773e54\" href=\"?note=b4c1ab1358773e54\" title=\"20-thm-konig\">20-thm-konig</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"4ef1aee16db6b308\" href=\"?note=4ef1aee16db6b308\" title=\"20-df-stages\">20-df-stages</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"e343870c773cb68e\" href=\"?note=e343870c773cb68e\" title=\"20-df-computable\">20-df-computable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"35073b74f84433b3\" href=\"?note=35073b74f84433b3\" title=\"20-df-pairing\">20-df-pairing</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\subseteq2^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\(T\\subseteq2^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Tree}_2(T)\">\\(\\operatorname{Tree}_2(T)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{code}[T]\\in\\mathcal R\">\\(\\operatorname{code}[T]\\in\\mathcal R\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\\subseteq2^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\(S\\subseteq2^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S_s\">\\(S_s\\)</span> 是给定的统一可计算递增有限枚举且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S=\\bigcup_sS_s\">\\(S=\\bigcup_sS_s\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[T]\\subseteq\\bigcup_{\\rho\\in S}[\\rho]\">\\([T]\\subseteq\\bigcup_{\\rho\\in S}[\\rho]\\)</span>。指标 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t\">\\(t\\)</span> 给出树编码集的全特征函数，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e\">\\(e\\)</span> 给出串枚举指标。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"b73290a0af01d44f\" href=\"?note=b73290a0af01d44f\" title=\"20-df-closed-class\">20-df-closed-class</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"59004ac6d23e86f8\" href=\"?note=59004ac6d23e86f8\" title=\"20-df-finite-code\">20-df-finite-code</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"84785d7ea3ad1a08\" href=\"?note=84785d7ea3ad1a08\" title=\"20-thm-cantor-compactness\">20-thm-cantor-compactness</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"b4c1ab1358773e54\" href=\"?note=b4c1ab1358773e54\" title=\"20-thm-konig\">20-thm-konig</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"4ef1aee16db6b308\" href=\"?note=4ef1aee16db6b308\" title=\"20-df-stages\">20-df-stages</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-13\" data-note=\"e343870c773cb68e\" href=\"?note=e343870c773cb68e\" title=\"20-df-computable\">20-df-computable</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-14\" data-note=\"35073b74f84433b3\" href=\"?note=35073b74f84433b3\" title=\"20-df-pairing\">20-df-pairing</a>。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g\\in\\mathcal C_1^{\\mathrm{tot}}\">\\(g\\in\\mathcal C_1^{\\mathrm{tot}}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g(s)=\\operatorname{fcode}(\\operatorname{code}[S_s])\">\\(g(s)=\\operatorname{fcode}(\\operatorname{code}[S_s])\\)</span>；给定阶段枚举包括该有限集编码的有效过程。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}effective\\text{-}finite\\text{-}cover}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\n\\exists s,n\\in\\omega\\ \\forall\\tau\\in T\\cap2^n\\ \\exists\\rho\\in S_s\\ [\\rho\\preceq\\tau],\\\\\nS_{e,s}:=\\{\\rho\\in2^{&lt;\\omega}:\\operatorname{code}(\\rho)\\in W_{e,s}\\},\\quad\nS_e:=\\bigcup_sS_{e,s},\\\\\n\\exists F\\in\\mathcal C_2\\ \\forall t,e\\in\\omega\\ \\forall V\\subseteq2^{&lt;\\omega}\\\n\\Bigl[(\\operatorname{Tree}_2(V)\\land\\varphi_t=\\chi_{\\operatorname{code}[V]}\n\\land[V]\\subseteq\\bigcup_{\\rho\\in S_e}[\\rho])\\Rightarrow\\\\\n\\exists s,n,d\\in\\omega\\ [F(t,e)\\downarrow=\\langle s,n,d\\rangle\n\\land d=\\operatorname{fcode}(\\operatorname{code}[S_{e,s}])\n\\land\\forall\\tau\\in V\\cap2^n\\ \\exists\\rho\\in S_{e,s}\\ (\\rho\\preceq\\tau)]\\Bigr],\\\\\nn_s:=\\max(\\{|\\rho|:\\rho\\in S_s\\}\\cup\\{0\\}),\\\\\n2^\\omega=\\bigcup_{\\rho\\in S_s}[\\rho]\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall\\tau\\in2^{n_s}\\ \\exists\\rho\\in S_s\\ [\\rho\\preceq\\tau].\n\\end{gathered}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}effective\\text{-}finite\\text{-}cover}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\n\\exists s,n\\in\\omega\\ \\forall\\tau\\in T\\cap2^n\\ \\exists\\rho\\in S_s\\ [\\rho\\preceq\\tau],\\\\\nS_{e,s}:=\\{\\rho\\in2^{&lt;\\omega}:\\operatorname{code}(\\rho)\\in W_{e,s}\\},\\quad\nS_e:=\\bigcup_sS_{e,s},\\\\\n\\exists F\\in\\mathcal C_2\\ \\forall t,e\\in\\omega\\ \\forall V\\subseteq2^{&lt;\\omega}\\\n\\Bigl[(\\operatorname{Tree}_2(V)\\land\\varphi_t=\\chi_{\\operatorname{code}[V]}\n\\land[V]\\subseteq\\bigcup_{\\rho\\in S_e}[\\rho])\\Rightarrow\\\\\n\\exists s,n,d\\in\\omega\\ [F(t,e)\\downarrow=\\langle s,n,d\\rangle\n\\land d=\\operatorname{fcode}(\\operatorname{code}[S_{e,s}])\n\\land\\forall\\tau\\in V\\cap2^n\\ \\exists\\rho\\in S_{e,s}\\ (\\rho\\preceq\\tau)]\\Bigr],\\\\\nn_s:=\\max(\\{|\\rho|:\\rho\\in S_s\\}\\cup\\{0\\}),\\\\\n2^\\omega=\\bigcup_{\\rho\\in S_s}[\\rho]\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall\\tau\\in2^{n_s}\\ \\exists\\rho\\in S_s\\ [\\rho\\preceq\\tau].\n\\end{gathered}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>紧致性给有限 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F\\subseteq S\">\\(F\\subseteq S\\)</span> 覆盖 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[T]\">\\([T]\\)</span>；取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\">\\(s\\)</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F\\subseteq S_s\">\\(F\\subseteq S_s\\)</span>。树中避开 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S_s\">\\(S_s\\)</span> 前缀的节点组成无路径的二进制树，König 引理使其某层为空，给所需 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span>。枚举 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(s,n)\">\\((s,n)\\)</span> 并作有限检验即可搜索证书。证书确实覆盖每条路径，因为每条路径有长度 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span> 的树前缀。</p>\n<p>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[T]=\\varnothing\">\\([T]=\\varnothing\\)</span>，有限空层本身为证书，可输出空覆盖。若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S_s=\\varnothing\">\\(S_s=\\varnothing\\)</span> 而 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 满，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n_s=0\">\\(n_s=0\\)</span> 的空串无覆盖前缀，算法不会误判。转换器仅对覆盖承诺保证停止；一般输入的覆盖性无需在此被判定。</p>\n<p>来源：印刷 169–170 / PDF 202–203。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-closed-class","status":"resolved","id":"b73290a0af01d44f","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-closed-class]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-finite-code","status":"resolved","id":"59004ac6d23e86f8","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-finite-code]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-thm-cantor-compactness","status":"resolved","id":"84785d7ea3ad1a08","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-thm-cantor-compactness]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-thm-konig","status":"resolved","id":"b4c1ab1358773e54","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-thm-konig]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-stages","status":"resolved","id":"4ef1aee16db6b308","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-stages]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-computable","status":"resolved","id":"e343870c773cb68e","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-computable